OL,3,GNEWSAUK minister urges social media
OL,4,Afirms to remove dangerous driving
OL,5,Avideos
OL,6,
OL,7,FDefence Minister Luke Pollard has
OL,8,Fcalled on social media companies to
OL,9,Fremove posts celebrating dangerous
OL,10,Fdriving, after a viral trend showing
OL,11,Fpeople going the wrong way down roads.
OL,13,FPollard told BBC Breakfast on Monday:
OL,14,F"Social media companies could take that
OL,15,Fdown today, adjust their algorithms so
OL,16,Fit's not celebrated."
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
